; Shared Spanish punctuation, 4 glyphs (E14): COMMA APOSTROPHE EXCL_OPEN QUEST_OPEN, same bold weight as
; font.tiles (2 px stems, punctuation on cols 2-3). Separate from font.tiles because appending them there
; pushed games/dungeon to 258 BG tiles (> 256). Use with "common_res": ["font", "font_lower", "font_es"]
; and put "font_es" right after the fonts in vram_order. Never reorder (code indexes by label).

@ COMMA
; ','  (tail drops into row 7 like the lowercase descenders)
